  enforced in code, independent done/blocked readings, row label borrowing,
  stable fallback error codes (src/errors.ts).
  Copyright (c) 2025 Cua AI, Inc.

vlad-terin/jev-use — https://github.com/vlad-terin/jev-use
  src/agent.ts reports per-phase timings in the shape jev-use uses.
  Copyright (c) 2026 jev-cua-bridge contributors.

awlevin/typesafe-computer-use — https://github.com/awlevin/typesafe-computer-use
